  "releaseNotes": "- Improved internal project structure for better maintainability and performance.\n\t\t\t- Fixed bugs across all cryptographic classes.\n\t\t\t- Documented OS incompatibilities:\n\t\t\t- ChaCha20 is **not supported** on iOS, tvOS, and browsers.\n\t\t\t- AES is **not supported** on browsers.\n\t\t\t- Added `namespace.cs` containing an enum for each algorithm type.\n\t\t\t- Introduced new interfaces:\n\t\t\t- `IEncryptionAlgorithm`\n\t\t\t- `IHashAlgorithm`\n\t\t\t- `IKeyDerivationAlgorithm`\n\t\t\t- Implemented corresponding concrete classes for each interface.\n\t\t\t- Enhanced parameter classes to provide better configurability and security options.",
  "repository": "",
